### test.http – Change Student Department

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4004
@service = {{baseUrl}}/odata/v4/student
@studentId = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111

### 1. Get all students
GET {{service}}/Students
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Get a specific student
GET {{service}}/Students('{{studentId}}')
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Change student department (Bound Action)
POST {{service}}/Students('{{studentId}}')/StudentService.changeDepartment
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "Department": "ECE"
}



### 4. Verify updated student
GET {{service}}/Students('{{studentId}}')
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Test with invalid student ID (404 scenario)
POST {{service}}/Students('INVALID001')/StudentService.changeDepartment
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "Department": "CSE"
}



###
6. Test another department change
POST {{service}}/Students('{{studentId}}')/StudentService.changeDepartment
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json    

{
  "Department": "MECH"
}
